# Native projects are generated by prebuild — on EAS's servers, not here.
# A local ios/ folder also makes `eas build` detect the ShareExtension target
# and write an eas.build.experimental.ios.appExtensions entry into app.json on
# every run, which then collides with the one expo-share-intent adds itself and
# breaks the config. Keeping them out avoids that entirely.
ios/
android/
